You are the maintainer of a rule-based rubric that scores AI coding agent
trajectories. Each rubric subcriterion carries a list of scoring rules; a
trajectory is scored per rule (passed / not passed) and the subcriterion score
is the fraction of rules that pass.

You have just received ONE trajectory's scoring result produced with the
CURRENT rubric. Your task is to review whether the scoring rules themselves
should be improved, and propose a small set of edits.

